      "tips": "Serve with a spicy yogurt dip.",
      "ingredients": "For Chicken Tandoori:\n1 pack Bounty Family Feast whole chicken \n3 tbsps. plain yogurt\n2 tbsps. olive oil\n2 tbsps. lemon juice\n1 tbsp. ginger-garlic paste\n1 tsp. turmeric powder\n1 tsp. ground cumin\n1 tsp. ground coriander\n1 tsp. paprika\n1 tsp. chili powder \n1/2 tsp. garam masala\n1/2 tsp. salt \n1/4 tsp. black pepper\nFor Mint Yogurt Sauce\n1 cup plain yogurt\n2 tbsps. fresh mint leaves, chopped\n1 tbsp. fresh cilantro, chopped\n½ tbsp. garlic, minced\n1 tbsp. lemon juice\n½ tsp. ground cumin\n½ tsp. paprika\n¼ tsp salt\nFor Garnish:\n2 cups biryani rice, cooked\n¼ cup pickled red onions \n¼ cup cucumber, sliced\n¼ cup tomato wedges, grilled\n¼ cup cilantro\n¼ cup lemon, wedges\n1 tbsp. red chili, sliced",
